// Sum of the lower and upper central winning labeled hammings.
// An odd count adds that central value twice.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hcsum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hcsum rank

IMPULSE hcsum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hcsum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
